summary.label:
2kmtCorner is an application that allows you to stay up to date in the world of nba 2k my team. In the application you will find all the cards in the game with:

- attributes;
- Xbox one, Ps4, Xbox series x, ps5 tags;
- trends;
- hot areas;
- coaches;
- shoes;
- comparison of cards;

2kmtCorner, can be used both online and offline, thus guaranteeing you the possibility to check your possible players at any time.

Good fun.
